      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I've been unable to reproduce this issue on the Open Beta build.  I've tested several avatars including using the avatar shown in the screenshots from the original poster.\n\nIf someone is experiencing this issue please reply back on this post with the steps involved, the avatar id used and the world in which this happened.  Any additional info would also be helpful.  Does this happen with every avatar, only certain ones, etc...\n\nGiven the number of reports it's likely there is some bug, but there is some missing info to reproduce it.\n\nScaling bones from the base or other parent transform has been a feature from the release of PhysBones.  This does not require someone to use IsAnimated.",
